        <div class="tab-content"><div class="tab-pane active" id="scanner"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-7"><div class="qr-panel"><div class="qr-section-label"><i class="fa fa-circle"></i> READY TO SCAN</div><h4 class="qr-scan-title">Scan your staff ID card</h4><div class="qr-scan-subtitle">Use a barcode scanner, or type the employee ID and press Enter.</div><div class="qr-input-wrap"><i class="fa fa-barcode"></i><input id="scan-code" class="form-control" autocomplete="off" autofocus placeholder="Scan your ID card QR code / barcode" <?php echo !$settings['scanner_enabled'] ? 'disabled' : ''; ?>></div><div class="qr-tip"><i class="fa fa-keyboard-o"></i><div><strong>Scanner ready</strong><br>Scanner guns act like keyboards. This field stays ready for the next scan.</div></div><div class="qr-tip"><i class="fa fa-clock-o"></i><div><strong>Automatic in / out</strong><br>First scan checks in; the next scan checks out.</div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-5"><div id="scan-result" class="qr-status-panel"><div class="qr-empty"><div class="qr-symbol"><i class="fa fa-qrcode"></i></div><h4>Waiting for a scan</h4><p>Staff details and attendance status will appear here.</p></div></div></div></div></div>
        <?php if ($settings['camera_enabled']) { ?><div class="tab-pane" id="camera"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-7"><div class="qr-panel"><div class="qr-section-label"><i class="fa fa-circle"></i> CAMERA SCANNER</div><div class="qr-camera"><video id="camera-video" playsinline></video><div id="html5-reader"></div><div class="qr-guide"></div><div id="camera-help" class="qr-camera-help"><i class="fa fa-camera"></i>Start the camera and hold the QR code in the highlighted area.</div></div><button type="button" id="start-camera" class="btn btn-primary mt-3"><i class="fa fa-camera"></i> Start camera</button><p class="text-muted mt-2 mb-0">Camera scanning needs HTTPS and browser permission.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-5"><div id="camera-result" class="qr-status-panel"><div class="qr-empty"><div class="qr-symbol"><i class="fa fa-mobile"></i></div><h4>Camera not started</h4><p>Use your device camera to scan a QR code.</p></div></div></div></div></div><?php } ?></div>
